    "text": "7stages.org\nwebsite\nAtlanta\nJuneteenth 2025 – Rereleasing “Blood Flow” film in remembrance of Robert Earl Price\nBy Devi Wells,\n10 hours agoToday, on Juneteenth, we celebrate the life and works of a great poet, playwright, champion of Black consciousness and resistance. Robert Earl Price worked with 7 Stages since the 1980’s alongside founders Del Hamilton and Faye Allen. His plays, like HUSH: Composing Blind Tom Wiggins and All Blues graced our stages with beautiful and challenging art.",
